BENGALOT PRODUCT IMAGE PROMPTS
===============================

WHAT THIS FILE IS FOR
---------------------
Use these prompts in ChatGPT to turn one real product photo into a clean, colourful
Bengalot catalogue image. Upload the product photo, paste the master prompt, then add
the colour block for the colour you need. Generate one image per colour so the whole
catalogue looks like one brand.

The product must stay the same product. Only the fabric colour, background and light
should change.

HOW TO USE
----------
1. Upload the real product photo to ChatGPT.
2. Paste the MASTER PROMPT.
3. Add ONE colour block from COLOUR PROMPTS.
4. Add ONE angle suffix from ANGLE SUFFIXES.
5. Generate at 4:5. Check the neckline, sleeves, seams and print before keeping it.
6. If the shape changed, regenerate instead of editing the result by hand.

MASTER PROMPT
-------------
Edit the uploaded product photo into a premium Bengalot e-commerce image.

Keep the exact same garment or accessory: same silhouette, cut, fit, length, neckline,
sleeves, seams, stitching, buttons, hardware, embroidery placement, print scale,
pattern and product proportions. Do not redesign, crop or distort the product. Do not
add or remove details. Preserve the original logo, label, zipper and hardware exactly
if present.

Change only the main fabric colour to {{COLOUR_NAME}} ({{COLOUR_HEX}}). Keep the
fabric weave, natural folds, texture and finish visible through the new colour. If the
product has embroidery, a print or a border, keep every part of that design exactly as
it is in the uploaded photo and recolour only the base fabric.

Place the product on a warm ivory studio background (#F7F1E6) with one soft Bengalot
brand accent: deep indigo (#3B2A8C), saffron (#E9A93A), magenta (#C2255C), jade
(#175C4A) or terracotta (#D9693F). Use one accent only, subtle and out of focus, never
overpowering the product. Soft diffused daylight from the upper left, gentle realistic
contact shadow, clean editorial styling, luxury South Asian fashion brand,
photo-realistic e-commerce product photography, sharp focus on the product, 4:5
vertical composition with generous breathing room, high resolution, no text, no
watermark, no logo overlay, no mannequin, no human, no extra props, no hangers, no
busy background.

NEGATIVE PROMPT
---------------
Do not change the product shape, colour-block placement, embroidery pattern, neckline,
sleeve length, hem, buttons, stitching, fabric texture or proportions. No mannequin,
no person, no hands, no extra clothing, no text, no watermark, no logo, no cartoon, no
illustration, no low-resolution blur, no oversaturated colour, no plastic-looking
fabric, no distorted seams, no extra pockets, no floating product, no harsh shadows,
no pure white background, no cluttered props.

ANGLE SUFFIXES (choose one)
---------------------------
- FRONT: "Front-facing flat lay, product centred, camera directly above."
- THREE-QUARTER: "Three-quarter angle, slight perspective, product centred."
- DETAIL: "Close-up detail of the fabric, embroidery and finish, shallow depth of field."
- BACK: "Back-facing flat lay showing the reverse construction and finish."
- WORN: "Styled on an invisible mannequin so the drape and fit are visible, no face, no
  hands, clean ivory background."

